{"id":29909,"slug":"the-three-musketeers","title":"The Three Musketeers","year":1973,"country":"United Kingdom, United States","duration":107,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/29909-the-three-musketeers","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/d1c84b9d0da2fac9dbbb35b34a29bb00/aF66ZcKVPjb3Wga1Y2AOV2qDv46VG8_large.jpg","description":"Richard Lester’s spirited adaptation of Alexandre Dumas’s timeless novel immediately distinguished itself from previous film versions with its irresistible lightheartedness. It follows the brash, young wannabe musketeer d’Artagnan (Michael York) as he travels from the French countryside to Paris and befriends Athos (Oliver Reed), Porthos (Frank Finlay), and Aramis (Richard Chamberlain), famed swordsmen whom he must help to stop the conniving Cardinal Richelieu (Charlton Heston) and his plot to undermine the king. The Three Musketeers sweeps viewers away with its exquisite sets and costumes, chivalric romance, and breathless duels punctuated by the ingenious physical comedy that was Lester’s trademark.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Richard Lester","slug":"richard-lester"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Michael York","role":"D’Artagnan","slug":"michael-york"},{"actor":"Oliver Reed","role":"Athos","slug":"oliver-reed"},{"actor":"Raquel Welch","role":"Constance de Bonacieux","slug":"raquel-welch"},{"actor":"Richard Chamberlain","role":"Aramis","slug":"richard-chamberlain"},{"actor":"Frank Finlay","role":"Porthos","slug":"frank-finlay"},{"actor":"Christopher Lee","role":"Comte de Rochefort","slug":"christopher-lee"},{"actor":"Geraldine Chaplin","role":"Queen Anna of Austria","slug":"geraldine-chaplin"},{"actor":"Jean-Pierre Cassel","role":"King Louis XIII","slug":"jean-pierre-cassel"},{"actor":"Charlton Heston","role":"Cardinal Richelieu","slug":"charlton-heston"},{"actor":"Faye Dunaway","role":"Milady de Winter","slug":"faye-dunaway"},{"actor":"Simon Ward","role":"Duke of Buckingham","slug":"simon-wa